WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.240 line:90%,end
A storm was raging over the Broken Isles.

2
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:06.880 line:90%,end
The team had been walking for hours since escaping the fortress.

3
00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:09.400 line:90%,end
Pusula, where is the signal coming from?

4
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.100 line:90%,end
From that house.

5
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.800 line:90%,end
A single human heart is beating inside.

6
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.960 line:90%,end
At the tip of the island stood a stone house whose light hadn't gone out for centuries.

7
00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.820 line:90%,end
The door opened before they even knocked.

8
00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.520 line:90%,end
I've been waiting for you, number 23.

9
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.840 line:90%,end
Waiting for a very long time.

10
00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:28.670 line:90%,end
How do you know us?

11
00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.140 line:90%,end
Who are you?

12
00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.800 line:90%,end
My name is Kael. I am the guardian of these islands.

13
00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:36.960 line:90%,end
Come inside. Sila's eyes are everywhere.

14
00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:40.740 line:90%,end
That mark on the door... It's Taran's mark!

15
00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:45.140 line:90%,end
Taran was my oldest friend. He sent you to me.

16
00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:48.040 line:90%,end
Sergeant immediately curled up in front of the fireplace.

17
00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:50.800 line:90%,end
The old man smiled and stroked the cat.

18
00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:53.720 line:90%,end
Sergeant never warmed up to anyone this quickly.

19
00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:57.410 line:90%,end
Kael, do you know what happened to me?

20
00:00:57.460 --> 00:00:59.560 line:90%,end
Why can't I remember anything?

21
00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:04.580 line:90%,end
I know. But first, you must hear what happened in 2099.

22
00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:07.820 line:90%,end
Kael placed his hand on the crystal table.

23
00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:11.940 line:90%,end
And the room filled with images from 300 years ago.

24
00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:17.260 line:90%,end
The Earth was dying. The oceans dried up. The sky turned gray.

25
00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:20.840 line:90%,end
The last scientists built 23 capsules.

26
00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:23.290 line:90%,end
To put humanity's last hope to sleep.

27
00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:26.420 line:90%,end
The capsules were secretly launched into the sky.

28
00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:29.360 line:90%,end
And they reached the floating islands, Elyra.

29
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.280 line:90%,end
I was the last guardian of that ship.

30
00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:34.940 line:90%,end
Elyra's crystals kept me alive.

31
00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:37.400 line:90%,end
I've been waiting for you for 200 years.

32
00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:40.980 line:90%,end
So we're humanity's last seeds?

33
00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:46.060 line:90%,end
Yes. And Sila wants to turn those seeds into her own army.

34
00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:48.560 line:90%,end
Then why does she want Leon?

35
00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:52.130 line:90%,end
Because the key to the capsules is in Leon's memory.

36
00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:54.400 line:90%,end
That's why Sila erased it.

37
00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:58.340 line:90%,end
At that very moment, Pusula's light turned red.

38
00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:01.820 line:90%,end
Warning. There are hundreds of signals around the island.

39
00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:06.540 line:90%,end
Sila's drones burst out of the storm and surrounded the house.

40
00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:08.860 line:90%,end
A giant face appeared in the sky.

41
00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:13.960 line:90%,end
Kael, my old friend. Give me Leon, and your island lives.

42
00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:18.060 line:90%,end
I've been stopping you for years, Sila. I'll stop you today too.

43
00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:21.090 line:90%,end
Then you'll sink with your island.

44
00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:25.980 line:90%,end
The drones opened fire. The crystals under the house began to crack.

45
00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:28.320 line:90%,end
The island is falling! The island is falling!

46
00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:31.440 line:90%,end
Mony, the shield is yours! I'll take Leon.

47
00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:34.620 line:90%,end
The shield is up. But it won't hold for long.

48
00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:37.860 line:90%,end
I'll freeze the drones. Everyone to the bridge.

49
00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:40.960 line:90%,end
Mira's ice froze the drones in midair.

50
00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:44.280 line:90%,end
And Sergeant was the first to find the hidden bridge.

51
00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:47.000 line:90%,end
Good boy, Sergeant! He found the way.

52
00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:49.490 line:90%,end
At the last moment, the team crossed to the other island.

53
00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:53.880 line:90%,end
Behind them, Kael's island sank into the clouds.

54
00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:57.800 line:90%,end
Kael... your home, your island... all gone.

55
00:02:58.620 --> 00:03:02.480 line:90%,end
A house can be rebuilt, my dear. But there's no other like you.

56
00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:06.180 line:90%,end
I'll find that key in my memory. I promise.

57
00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:12.300 line:90%,end
Kael looked below the fortress. There, 18 capsules were still sleeping.

58
00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:14.970 line:90%,end
Tomorrow we start waking them up.

59
00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:20.000 line:90%,end
But among the clouds, Sila's eyes were still watching them.

60
00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:23.380 line:90%,end
Go ahead, wake them. I'll be waiting for them too.

